      hu: "A kabuli Nagy Mecsetként is ismert épület az ország egyik legnagyobb iszlám imahelye. Kupolái a főváros sziluettje fölé magasodnak.",
      ro: "Cunoscută și sub numele de Marea Moschee din Kabul, este una dintre cele mai mari din țară. Cupolele sale domină orizontul capitalei.",
      en: "Also known as the Grand Mosque of Kabul, it is one of the largest Islamic places of worship in the country. Its domes dominate the skyline."
